:: stat-checks-system [script nobr]
/*
  STAT CHECK RESOLUTION
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  Reserved for the dice/threshold logic day content will call
  to resolve stat checks, e.g.:

    window.resolveStatCheck = function (statName, difficulty) {
      var val = State.variables[statName] || 0;
      var roll = Math.floor(Math.random() * 20) + 1;
      return (val + roll) >= difficulty;
    };

  and a matching <<statCheck "statGRA" 12>> widget that branches
  passage output on success/failure. Left as a stub until the
  first day content that needs a check defines the exact rules
  (flat vs. opposed, roll vs. threshold, etc.).
*/
